<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces have stepped up border patrols and fired warning shots after Myanmar bombs damaged a health centre and artillery struck villages in Tak and Mae Sot, prompting a pause to unofficial trade. Myanmar police arrested 83 Thais in a border-hotel scam raid while Thailand boosted its Myanmar border security and issued a Mae Hong Son alert over possible air strikes on Karen forces. Refugees from Myanmar are filling labor gaps as Cambodians return home, and cross-border QR payments are being introduced in Bangkok's historic shopping districts. A 15‑year-old Thai golfer was killed and a caddy injured by lightning at a tournament in Chachoengsao, and a Thai opposition leader was targeted in a spyware attack. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPT0hFWHdXT3NFQzVVVTVhNzl5dkUtVnVjZUlGd202TG1ERkluOW1MWk12TU8wUU40MW1kV0FYc2NqQVBJM0lvWk05Y1FFQUM0YWMzN0tTbkRvMlBwbXBpeTA3dVhvWEl3X1B6QVRjSXlCcjRGYmpZMnhpa0ZzOW1SQ0tSRXRKUTJZZWM2alBrbmpnWDdETzd0ZHBER3poSUdCcmVhY3lTWWZickVjVEtRd0ZIRFFBRDh4Wnhr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaosod English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNS1o0MkdBbzJXZ09QREFFQkhoOVk5Vm1fMlJRQk1UNnA0ZFFrYkViLU10YmxsNmFUc2tpMG5SYVFuSXk2Vlp1anQ3R3ozUnRBMDFZT3djaDd2UGJuaUk0YWxMa1prTjFGQ2F0SHFNUXQxU2RYNzJNRThtTzJoNnRmWjg4cEVXNEczckpvZ3E0c1FtbVZTNzkyLUo1V1ZTWkluQXdxZnQ0bWNDVzZXdnV1TlpHX0Fqc0doQ0lhNw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Free Malaysia Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNWDQxYk5nSC1tMFBkZ2FJU20tblItOFlISXBMbm40a2VpYXFRM25nZXN1QXZWenRpSXUxbk5sbEhlWEc0VDF5ZHdKUmJMOVpUNmlGTUl1cmU0MUhETlhxcVNjSzBELUx4bjBydWxpN2UzRGZFVGJXUEJrR29uekJEaC1uTW5lcDd1WVp5eEpJd3Z2d2pCa1FEOHRWZHRnOHNaVU5HTlNx